<view class="page-nucleic-confirm">
  <view class="container">
    <view class="card">
      <view class="section-title">确认预约信息</view>
      <view class="nc-row">
        <text class="nc-label">就诊人</text>
        <text class="nc-value">{{patientName || '—'}}</text>
      </view>
      <view class="nc-row">
        <text class="nc-label">检测日期</text>
        <text class="nc-value">{{appointmentDate || '—'}}</text>
      </view>
      <view class="text-muted nc-note">
        首版仅演示预约流程；规格未定义采样地点与具体时段，故本页不显示。
      </view>
    </view>

    <button
      class="btn-primary nc-submit"
      loading="{{submitting}}"
      disabled="{{submitting}}"
      bindtap="onSubmit"
    >确认预约</button>
    <button class="btn-outline nc-back" bindtap="onBackEdit">返回修改</button>
  </view>
</view>
